OL,3,GNEWSATown's Christmas lights secured
OL,4,Aafter funding fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FChristmas lights will be installed in a
OL,7,FNorth Yorkshire seaside town after
OL,8,Fconcerns were raised earlier about how
OL,9,Fthey would be funded.
OL,11,FScarborough Town Council has been
OL,12,Fhanded responsibility for its festive
OL,13,Filluminations, which had previously
OL,14,Fbeen paid for by North Yorkshire
OL,15,FCouncil.
OL,17,FAfter being gifted a "significant
OL,18,Famount of string light braids" by
OL,19,FScarborough Fair, the lights would be
OL,20,Fdelivered under budget, councillors
OL,21,Fhave been told.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
