OL,3,GNEWSATown's Christmas lights secured
OL,4,Aafter funding fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #29,000 contract will see Acorn
OL,7,FLighting Services, based in Selby, test
OL,8,Fand install the infrastructure and
OL,9,Fremove the Christmas lights after the
OL,10,Ffestive season.
